{"parse": {"title": "打虎记-01", "pageid": 134665, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A8%8B%E5%92%8C%E5%85%89%C2%B7%E6%89%93%E8%99%8E%E8%AE%B0\" title=\"程和光·打虎记\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">打虎记-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%89%93%E8%99%8E%E8%AE%B0-02\" title=\"打虎记-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">打虎记</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.99.BD.E5.B1.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"白屋\">白屋</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 白屋</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Cage</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_08.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_08\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_08\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Cg-3_4_bg_08.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_08.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Cg-3_4_bg_08.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_08.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Cg-3_4_bg_08.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_08.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷澈的天压着黑色的瓦，黑瓦压着白色的墙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>墙下是清晨新扫过的院子。不过几个时辰，上面便又积了薄薄一层雪。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_05\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光抱着木柴进屋，给炉灶生了火。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>在衙门抄书，折下来一天仍是三十文左右。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他从架子上取下账本与砚台，取笔蘸墨，细细记录今日的收支。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>售卖鲈鱼一条，赚得七文。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>支出：芹菜四文，盐一斤五文，药材十文。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有人轻步走到程和光身后，给他披上一件衣裳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>回来了？咳……冬天一年比一年冷了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>您不该起来的。我刚去吴郎中那里抓了些百部，他之前也说静养——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>好了，你怎么又去他那里？平时不是去济世堂么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>我想请他开副新方子——我听说他又新制了些大造丸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>拿到了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>唉，我早不许你去！早说要断绝来往。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>他是不是又对你说些浑话，不许你进门，说是因为病气……咳咳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光顿了一下，合起账本。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>无妨。药买回来了，我这便熬药。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>他说了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门口的梅枝抖落几抔雪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵叩门声适时地打断了尴尬的沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>有客人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>自你二叔搬回乡下，家里好久没来人了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光将账本放回架上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>我先去看看。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_08.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_08\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_08\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Cg-3_4_bg_08.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_08.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Cg-3_4_bg_08.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_08.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Cg-3_4_bg_08.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_08.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光踏雪走回院门，抬起门闩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门外站着一位熟悉的武官。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>厉守备？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-642401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-642401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-642401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">厉晦锋：</div><div>嗯。和光，没打扰到你吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>我刚从医馆回来，正打算熬药。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-642401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-642401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-642401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">厉晦锋：</div><div>……令堂的病情如何了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>痨病难治。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>您找我，是衙门有事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>厉晦锋对他露出了一个可称和蔼的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-642401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-642401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-642401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">厉晦锋：</div><div>衙门的事不归我管。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-642401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-642401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-642401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">厉晦锋：</div><div>我这次来，是为了给你<span style=\"color:#FDE0BB\"><b>一个机会</b></span>。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_05\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光攥着一张泛黄的纸返回屋内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>炉灶上的锅盖已被掀开，熬好的米粥正冒出腾腾的热气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他习惯性地从母亲手里接走了汤勺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>这些事我来做就好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>刚刚是谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>是厉守备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光把粥端上木桌，顺手把那张纸递给母亲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……我明日去找二姨，拜托她来照顾一阵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>我要出趟远门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几只麻雀掠过窗外，叽叽喳喳飞出了院子。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_04.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_04\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_04\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_4_bg_04.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_04.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_4_bg_04.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_04.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_4_bg_04.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_04.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是涣州府别县治下的一个小村落，依山傍水，故称水乡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>水乡的风貌与祝县相似。程和光走到村口，又一次看见了黑瓦所勾勒的起伏轮廓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只是今日的晌午不如往日般宁静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乡民首领：</div><div>我兄弟被大虫咬伤，命悬一线！你们这些走狗还在这推三阻四！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>村口左侧是一处华贵非常的院落，门外还竖立着“忠孝节义”的牌坊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>牌坊下已经聚了些面红耳赤的乡民，正对着拦阻的家丁叫嚷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……应是本地士绅的房子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光沉默靠近，混入周围几个看热闹的闲汉中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">严肃的家丁：</div><div>秀郎中是我家真金白银请来的！她正在里面给朝奉开方把脉，岂能容得你们乱闯！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乡民首领：</div><div>秀郎中是咱们水乡的医生，又不是你胡家自己的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乡民首领：</div><div>什么病比人命还紧急！你凭什么拦着我们？你家有什么不能见人的宝贝吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乡民首领：</div><div>你进去和秀郎中说，这有个快死了的病人——她一定会先出来救人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">严肃的家丁：</div><div>你就非要看这一个大夫不成？不如早早动身去县里，还来得及天黑前进城。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乡民首领：</div><div>我们下山就去了秀郎中的医馆。伙计说她在你们家，我们便一路颠簸走到这——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乡民首领：</div><div>你看他，还像是能挨到县里的样子吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>受伤的乡民伏在同伴背上，草草包扎的左臂已是血肉模糊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">严肃的家丁：</div><div>这些我不管，又不是我们伤了他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">严肃的家丁：</div><div>你们再这样围着胡朝奉的院子生事，我们就要叫保长来抓人了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>为首的乡民怒喝一声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乡民首领：</div><div>叫吧，叫吧！你们原本就是一伙的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乡民首领：</div><div>胡海岳怕死，手划破一道口子也要请郎中开药——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">严肃的家丁：</div><div>你别血口喷人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乡民首领：</div><div>咱们的人被咬成重伤，连门槛都迈不进去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷静的乡民：</div><div>他家趁着田价贱，用一两银子就买了我两亩地……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-622720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-622720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-622720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沮丧的乡民：</div><div>去年我因为丧事，急需用钱。胡家放债，最后竟然要收我五分的利息……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乡民首领夺过同伴手里的弓箭，竟对着家丁拉开了弓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乡民首领：</div><div>胡家就是故意欺负我们！不是买田就是追债，不想让我们活了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乡民首领：</div><div>乡亲们，你们说这公平吗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乡民们：</div><div>不公平！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>其余乡民愤怒地应和，举起手中的锄头和棍棒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乡民首领：</div><div>我们等不了！我们不忍了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乡民首领：</div><div>我今天非要进门不可！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乡民们：</div><div>咱们也不是好欺负的，把他家大门烧了！闯进去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>家丁们抽出腰刀，举起盾牌，组成一堵密不透风的人墙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">严肃的家丁：</div><div>那你们就试试！简直是要造反——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话音刚落，一支羽箭已经向着家丁的眉心飞来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——只是未及射中，便被刀光劈为两半。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光收刀入鞘，挡在家丁与乡民中间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>人命关天，放他们进去又有何不可？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">严肃的家丁：</div><div>你是谁？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷静的乡民：</div><div>不是我们的人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们面面相觑，像是被打断了演出的戏班，不知如何是好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">严肃的家丁：</div><div>你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>紧闭的大门被人猛然推开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-647202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-647202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-647202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>外面在吵什么！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "打虎记-01"}}